{
  "name": "LendLoop 02 — Daily overdue reminders",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## LendLoop — workflow 2: daily overdue reminders\n\n**Schedule:** every day at 09:00 (set the n8n timezone to your community's).\n\n**Flow:** sign a request → Convex `POST /n8n/overdue-check` returns approved loans past their return date → one reminder email per loan → signed write-back to `POST /n8n/reminder-logged`.\n\n**Idempotency:** each reminder's `eventId` is `overdue:<requestId>:<YYYY-MM-DD>` — same-day reruns dedupe in Convex; the next day produces a fresh reminder.\n\n**Setup:** same env vars as workflow 1; SMTP credential on the email node; Error Workflow → workflow 03.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000200",
      "name": "Sticky note — setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 9,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000201",
      "name": "Daily 09:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -80,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Build a signed request body for the Convex overdue-check endpoint.\n\nfunction sign(rawBody) {\n  const secret = $env.LENDLOOP_WEBHOOK_SECRET;\n  if (!secret) throw new Error('LENDLOOP_WEBHOOK_SECRET is not set in the n8n environment.');\n  return require('crypto').createHmac('sha256', secret).update(rawBody, 'utf8').digest('hex');\n}\nfunction convexUrl(path) {\n  const base = ($env.CONVEX_SITE_URL || '').replace(/\\/$/, '');\n  if (!base) throw new Error('CONVEX_SITE_URL is not set in the n8n environment (use the .convex.site URL).');\n  return base + path;\n}\nconst rawBody = JSON.stringify({ source: 'n8n-overdue-cron', requestedAt: new Date().toISOString() });\nreturn [{ json: {\n  rawBody,\n  signature: 'sha256=' + sign(rawBody),\n  url: convexUrl('/n8n/overdue-check'),\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000202",
      "name": "Sign overdue-check request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        140,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-LendLoop-Signature",
              "value": "={{ $json.signature }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "raw",
        "rawContentType": "application/json",
        "body": "={{ $json.rawBody }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000203",
      "name": "Fetch overdue loans from Convex",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        360,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// One claim per overdue loan per UTC day. An address is required for delivery.\nconst res = $input.first().json;\nconst today = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);\nconst loans = Array.isArray(res.overdue) ? res.overdue : [];\nreturn loans.filter((loan) => loan.borrowerEmail).map((loan) => ({ json: {\n  ...loan,\n  eventId: 'overdue:' + loan.borrowRequestId + ':' + today,\n  toEmail: loan.borrowerEmail,\n  subject: 'LendLoop reminder: \"' + loan.toolName + '\" is ' + loan.daysOverdue + ' day(s) overdue',\n  text: [\n    'Hi ' + loan.borrowerName + ',',\n    '',\n    'Just a friendly nudge: the \"' + loan.toolName + '\" you borrowed from ' + loan.ownerName +\n      ' was due back on ' + loan.endDate + ' and is now ' + loan.daysOverdue + ' day(s) overdue.',\n    'Please arrange the return as soon as you can.',\n    '',\n    '— LendLoop',\n  ].join('\\n'),\n} }));"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000204",
      "name": "Flatten overdue list",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        580,
        200
      ]
    },
